  "published": "2026-10-08T20:57:30.517Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds lists, block quotes, code spans and blocks, horizontal rules, setext headings, escapes, entities and hard line breaks; a LinkClicked event; keyboard scrolling; and CodeBackColor, RuleColor and PreserveLineBreaks properties. Fixes double-subtracted padding, orphaned punctuation after styled text, non-wrapping headings, overflowing long words, broken underlines across spaces, and emphasis false positives such as snake_case_names. Parsing now happens once per text change and painting is clipped to the visible area. Breaking: MarkdownRenderer, TextRun and MarkdownLayout are now internal, and a newline inside a paragraph is a LineBreakInline in the AST instead of a \"\\n\" in a TextInline.",
